{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0364_1000_005yay", "source_sha256": "0aef3a2ac1f67e2f4127cae8db3da1e7d837d6576fb9b5119e09b814993d6197", "ja": "{$P$}、ここにいたんですね！\nお疲れさまですっ！", "zh": "{$P$}，原来您在这里呀！\n辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0364_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d73685957ae5fba8e865d5b9c0ef71a19d256554e6e2878971632e93c2cf4f0e", "ja": "お疲れさま、やよい。\nお、今日もその服なんだな。", "zh": "辛苦了，弥生。\n哦，今天也穿着那件衣服啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0364_1002_005yay", "source_sha256": "6f8d0ef6e0bef0305202379a42e1dde529dee3f2bdf75c64a7339fa58a631ccb", "ja": "はい！　すっかり気に入っちゃって。\nこの服着てると、なんだかウキウキしちゃうんです。", "zh": "是的！我已经彻底喜欢上它了。\n穿着这身衣服，总觉得心情特别雀跃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0364_1003_005yay", "source_sha256": "8d45f79493b5320642a71d60f22446f9e7145ac9774566821e91d77eeb3248d6", "ja": "だからお休みの時だけじゃなくて、\nお仕事の時もいっぱい着ようかなーって！", "zh": "所以我不光想在休息的时候穿，工作的时候也想多穿穿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0364_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a0ef2b0401fd2da3a9d8ea3b56053f94df6669d850ec2495fd2081026a52ac23", "ja": "それはいいな。いつもの服もいいけど、あらためて、\nその服もやよいによく似合ってるよ。", "zh": "那很好啊。平时的衣服也不错，不过现在再看，这身衣服也很适合弥生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0364_1005_p", "source_sha256": "4bb0e545246b4604237bf6bf81969c75eaad5f27d69ab39c4339c5f361385e86", "ja": "髪型も合ってると思うし……。\nうん、何度見ても、すごく可愛いぞ！", "zh": "我觉得发型也很搭……\n嗯，不管看多少次，还是觉得特别可爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0364_1006_005yay", "source_sha256": "724606fef4d2f0f6e881d41b38eafbeb983597e254b7827522ae5dd3e0a8307b", "ja": "えへへ……何度も褒めてくれてありがとうございます！\n{$P$}が教えてくれたんですよね。", "zh": "嘿嘿……谢谢你夸了我这么多次！\n是{$P$}教我的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0364_1007_005yay", "source_sha256": "2d244a42a47cd224d166e5e0a6361416c001f2add0a5999440e8f0e98100a2b0", "ja": "お金をかけなくても、色や組み合わせの工夫とか、\n髪型との合わせ方とかで、おしゃれは楽しめるって！", "zh": "就算不花钱，通过在颜色和搭配上下功夫，或者考虑怎么和发型搭配，也能享受时尚的乐趣！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0364_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d61e0c502a57af7264f3ec7e3ba492fa4041e59ca3ee5ba3c8c3ee0f4afb047e", "ja": "そうそう。ばっちり楽しめてるようで何よりだ。\n……ところで、何か用事があったんじゃないのか？", "zh": "对对。看样子你正享受其中，我就放心了。\n……对了，你不是还有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0364_1009_005yay", "source_sha256": "d16222d847c40c99f2416c67b0b7ba7c6188824c7d3fdc20d63a23c00d3c34a3", "ja": "あ、そうでした！　実は{$P$}に\nお願いしたいことがあるんです。", "zh": "啊，对了！其实我有件事想拜托{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0364_1010_005yay", "source_sha256": "fa7011f0a021d4c1c0ce9f6cc8d03da28e020eb0d5b10f6d24932cb7ff99614b", "ja": "えっと、次のお休みなんですけど……\nお買い物に付き合ってもらえませんか？", "zh": "那个，下次休息日……能陪我去买东西吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0364_1011_p", "source_sha256": "072ec21517662ce49548ddf2c027e0313693a1a46f261b20b79348f623bc82c9", "ja": "買い物？　別に構わないぞ。\nもしかして、服を買いに行くとか？", "zh": "买东西？我倒是没关系。难道是要去买衣服之类的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0364_1012_005yay", "source_sha256": "c4fe321efd496f35904ddf3fbbd0fcac80609d004d8b7a1c516cae3faecce40f", "ja": "はい！　といっても私のじゃなくて\n妹のカスミの服選びを手伝ってもらいたいんですー。", "zh": "好的！不过不是买我的衣服，\n是想请你帮我给妹妹香澄挑衣服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0364_1013_005yay", "source_sha256": "13b83895816b0796b06bb653f6a4626a75f26759ba95a4f299af08d08cbb7583", "ja": "カスミ、今着てる服がすごくかわいいって\n褒めてくれるんですけど、", "zh": "霞总是夸我现在穿的衣服特别可爱，可是——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0364_1014_005yay", "source_sha256": "33f8441ca288f4ca86fe6bd97adb3020a2d849d21ec08920ff6c6c18ec2df285", "ja": "{$P$}にアドバイスしてもらった\nことを教えたら、自分も！　って言い出しちゃって。", "zh": "告诉她这是{$P$}给的建议之后，\n她就吵着说自己也要！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0364_1015_p", "source_sha256": "8cc48d15037214060421b9b444e53543499ba8508b8322928f81be4b32f7c8ef", "ja": "そういうことか。\nけど、本当に俺でいいのか？", "zh": "原来是这样啊。\n不过，真的由我来可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0364_1016_005yay", "source_sha256": "de72a9c3b0355f3d990b53f32be9244c82c04ff6642527577bebb9ceb69a908c", "ja": "もちろんです！　{$P$}、いつも\n私たちに似合う衣装を準備してくれますし……。", "zh": "当然啦！{$P$}先生总是会为我们准备合适的服装……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0364_1017_005yay", "source_sha256": "6a87a1751e5f9c3e32901170b4a80e05459289b874faa4d44dab3ebdf83fa985", "ja": "きっとカスミにも、ピッタリの服が見つかると\n思うので！　私も、お願いできたらうれしいなーって。", "zh": "我觉得一定也能找到非常适合霞的衣服！要是我也能拜托您帮忙，我会很开心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0364_1018_p", "source_sha256": "31cb72632d8ddb7948cadb3b938f9aaf36cc5245c093150b41c5c55ee15c7d5d", "ja": "はは、それは責任重大だな。\nわかった、しっかりアドバイスできるよう頑張るよ。", "zh": "哈哈，这责任可不小啊。\n知道了，我会努力给出切实的建议。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0364_1019_005yay", "source_sha256": "134c8da6b4632204a7fac9e57853491bdbdaf1f4bc19f8854e549d9cad15050d", "ja": "うっうー！　ありがとうございます！\nカスミに似合うかわいい洋服、一緒に探しましょうね！", "zh": "呜呜——！谢谢您！\n一起找适合霞的可爱洋装吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
